WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:05.090
Oracle's percentage describes agreement,
not the chance of

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:06.170
a successful trade.

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:09.270
Open Oracle for the chart you are
reviewing.

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:12.070
In this example, 8 of 10 checks match.

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:15.310
8 divided by 10 gives 80% agreement.

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:18.850
Trace the summary back to ARIA's
underlying conditions.

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:21.510
These are the same checks, so the tools

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:23.210
are not independent confirmations.

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:27.530
A second illustrative snapshot has 6
matched checks.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:32.450
60% agreement. Read the unmet conditions
and

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:36.710
the verdict. Review the evidence before
building a paper plan.

